			name:    "Non-leap year income (2023)",
			income:  10000,
			year:    2023, // 2023 is not a leap year
			wantTax: 1000.0, // Expected: 10000 * 0.10
			wantErr: nil,
		},
		{
			name:    "Year 2100 (non-leap year, but buggy isLeapYear thinks it's leap)",
			income:  10000,
